    "Name": "Winston",
    "Details": "The Winston Combat Vehicle was a Republic of the Sphere frontline combat vehicle that began production in 3085. A Dark Age variant developed in 3114, this model is powered by an XXL Fusion Engine. It is armed with two AMS, two Clan-built LRM-15s, and twin TSEMP Cannons. The Targeting Computer remains as well.\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Biome Restrictions: None.</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Movement: 3/5 hexes / 90/150 meters.</color></b>\n\n<color=#ffcc00><b>Armor:</b> Heavy Ferro-Fibrous\n<b>Structure:</b> Structure\n<b>Values       A        S  </b>\n<b>Front</b>       350     35\n<b>Left</b>         285     35\n<b>Right</b>       285     35\n<b>Rear</b>        225     35\n<b>Turret</b>      270     35\n\n<b>Total</b>      1415    175</color>\n\n<color=#ff0000>Quirk: Improved Targeting - Long</color>",
    "Icon": "Winston"
  },
  "YangsThoughts": "The Winston is a solid Heavy tank Boss. Seventy tons of 'Mech would be better, but a Winston will do just fine.",
